let-hell bosses.\n\nIn SinsKiller you get a mix of bullet-hell and survivors like gameplay with no RNG, where movement, aim and timing matter most. You can choose from different magic elements to fit your playstyle then equip other items to create a build that feels truly yours. Each circle is inspired by the literary classis Divine Comedy while story itself draws inspiration from another Italian classic Jerusalem Delivered.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/sinskiller", "videos": [{"id": 195343, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "orzYxrnZwj8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=orzYxrnZwj8", "title": "SinsKiller Announcement Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/orzYxrnZwj8/fhddefault.jpg"}]}